; CLIP's input side for ASCII text and binary PPM images, as a pure library:
; the BPE tokenizer driven by a tokenizer.json, and the image preprocessing
; (Pillow's bicubic resize in its fixed-point form, centre crop, normalize).
; Nothing here reads a file or the network.

(library
 (name clip_input)
 (libraries fmt jsont jsont.bytesrw))
